<title>SINGAPORE: United Engineers first-half net rises.</title>
<headline>United Engineers first-half net rises.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of S$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		 7.37    vs    4.67</p>
<p>    Group share (cents)    4.80    vs    3.00</p>
<p>    Turnover		 251.33    vs  144.49</p>
<p>    Other income	     2.19    vs    2.09</p>
<p>    Interest expense	 2.27    vs    0.96</p>
<p>    Associates		 0.37    vs    1.11</p>
<p>    Pretax profit	   10.11    vs    5.67</p>
<p>    Tax			  4.26    vs    1.44</p>
<p>    Minorities (gain)	1.52    vs    0.44</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries (gain) 0.10    vs     nil</p>
<p>Note -- United Engineers Ltd is a diversified group  whose activities include engineering, construction and property development.--Singapore newsroom (65-8703080)</p>
</text>
